cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PharmaRL in your research, please cite the manuscript and software via the Zenodo DOIs below."
title: "PharmaRL: An OpenEnv-Native Benchmark for LLM-as-Policy Molecular Optimization"
abstract: >-
  PharmaRL is an OpenEnv-native benchmark for evaluating large language models as policies
  on iterative molecular optimization, with verifiable RLVE rewards on Therapeutics Data
  Commons oracles (DRD2, GSK3B, JNK3) and three structural reward-hacking defenses.
  Companion manuscript: "AI Alchemy in Medicine: A Vision for LLM-as-Policy Molecular
  Design via OpenEnv."
